  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resident Coordinator Special Purpose Trust</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the Danish support is enhanced RC system leadership at country, regional and global levels for advancing the effectiveness of UN support for the implementation of the SDGs and the 2030 Agenda, with the following objectives: 

1.	Effective action by UNCTs to deliver in-country results at a scale that responds to national priorities and needs.

2.	Strengthened UN cross-pillar collaboration for enhanced programmatic integration and impact to a.o. strengthen prevention for the 2030 Agenda.

3.	UNCT culture of accountability and transparency for development results towards countries and Member States, a.o. by the RCS operations remaining agile and fit-for-purpose; and ensuring effective implementation of UN Secretariat-wide management strategies and action plans.</narrative>
  </description>
